# Geo-Fence > Clear on a vehicle (PLAN.md 13.4, D11).
#
# clearToolStripMenuItem_Click sets FENCE_ENABLE, FENCE_ACTION and FENCE_TOTAL to 0 with setParam,
# one after another, each waiting for the vehicle's echo; a set that goes unanswered says "Failed
# to set ..." and stops there; then the geofence goes from the map (GCSViews/FlightPlanner.cs:
# 2112-2155). The sets go through the link's set_param with the C#'s retries, and plan.params is
# what each did: NAME=0 echoed, or NAME=0 unchanged where the vehicle already held 0 - which
# FENCE_ENABLE and FENCE_TOTAL do on a fresh SITL, and FENCE_ACTION (1, RTL and land) does not.
#
# The vehicle is left with FENCE_ACTION 0, as the C# leaves it.
#
# Needs SITL (a copter): tools/gui-test.sh tests/gui/plan-fence-clear-sitl.gui -- tcp:127.0.0.1:5760

env MP_CONFIG_XML $WORK/config.xml
env XDG_DATA_HOME $WORK
env MP_PLAN_DIR $WORK

screen params
window 1600x1200
budget 10
# A first budget, set by hand until a passing run records one.
# RawParamWarning, on the Full Parameter List's Activate (ConfigRawParams.cs:92): "Show me
# again?" unticked, so no later visit asks, and OK.
# The vehicle first: a click before its first heartbeat is a click the screen may forget
# (vehicle.connected only says the link is open).
expect vehicle.count > 0
click raw-param-warning-again
click raw-param-warning-ok

click param-download
expect params.held > 500

click tab-plan

# A geofence drawn on the map, to be cleared.
click draw-fence
# The first fence asks "FlightPlan Fence" with its "Show me again?" (row 92): unticked, so a
# later Draw Fence in this run is not asked again, then OK.
expect plan.prompt FlightPlan Fence
click plan-prompt-again
click plan-prompt-ok
expect plan.prompt none
# The map first: a press before its first paint records nothing.
expect map.ready true
click map@0.40x0.40
click map@0.60x0.40
click map@0.60x0.60
expect fence.points 3

click map@0.30x0.70:right
click menu-geoFence
click menu-clear
expect plan.params.busy false
expect plan.prompt none
expect plan.params ~ FENCE_ENABLE=0
expect plan.params ~ FENCE_ACTION=0
expect plan.params ~ FENCE_TOTAL=0
expect fence.points 0
